# switch-mid-switch (H3): x3 picked while x2 draws on. 200 ms after picking
# x2 (cell centre 174.5,187), x3 (cell centre 257.5,187) is picked; 83 ms
# later the half-faded whole x2 shows under the x3 stub.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 174.5 187
wait 200
click 257.5 187
wait 83
shot switch-mid-switch
